        "$\\int x\\sin 2x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x-\\int \\left(-\\frac{1}{2}\\cos 2x\\right)dx=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\cos 2x\\,dx$。",
        "$=-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{1}{4}\\sin 2x+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-\\frac{x}{2}\\cos 2x+\\frac{1}{4}\\sin 2x+C$",
      "claim": "D(-(x/2)*cos(2*x)+sin(2*x)/4) == x*sin(2*x)"
    },
    {
      "title": "定積分",
      "prompt": "$\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "$u=x$，$dv=\\cos x\\,dx$。$du=dx$，$v=\\sin x$。",
        "$\\int_0^\\pi x\\cos x\\,dx=[x\\sin x]_0^\\pi-\\int_0^\\pi \\sin x\\,dx$。",
        "$[x\\sin x]_0^\\pi=\\pi\\cdot 0-0=0$；$\\int_0^\\pi \\sin x\\,dx=[-\\cos x]_0^\\pi=1+1=2$。",
        "答案：$0-2=-2$。是負的：$x\\cos x$ 在 $(\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\pi)$ 為負，那一段的面積比 $(0,\\frac{\\pi}{2})$ 那一段大。"
      ],
      "answer": "$-2$",
      "claim": "INT(x*cos(x),0,pi) == -2"
    }
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "公式中間寫成加號：$uv+\\int v\\,du$。",
    "$du$ 算錯：$u=x$ 時 $du=dx$，新積分裡不會再有 $x$。",
    "挑反了 $u$ 和 $dv$，積分越做越難還繼續做。",
    "定積分時 $uv$ 那一項忘了代上下限。"
  ],
